OL,3,AThe critical tech staying safe by going
OL,4,Aunderground
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wall of white granite towered above a
OL,7,Fsmall team of engineers gathered in a
OL,8,FCalifornia quarry. The ancient,
OL,9,Fultra-hard material before them was, to
OL,10,Fmost things, completely impermeable.
OL,12,FThen the rock-melting tunnel-boring
OL,13,Fmachine (TBR) roared to life.
OL,15,F"It's kind of like igniting a rocket,"
OL,16,Fsays Troy Helming, founder and chief
OL,17,Fexecutive of EarthGrid, as he describes
OL,18,Fthe initially loud process of lighting
OL,19,Fup three plasma torches at the front of
OL,20,Fhis company's machine.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,115,105,200,160,0,100
