OL,3,AThe critical tech staying safe by going
OL,4,Aunderground
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose torches, set within a spinning
OL,7,Fhead, soon quieten down as they produce
OL,8,Fa stream of super-heated plasma
OL,9,Freaching 27,000C - significantly hotter
OL,10,Fthan the surface of the Sun.
